{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859750/extras/7c113e0c482749b414e9f13df6c79a33.poster.avif?t=1760385189\" width=720 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859750/extras/7c113e0c482749b414e9f13df6c79a33.webm?t=1760385189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859750/extras/7c113e0c482749b414e9f13df6c79a33.mp4?t=1760385189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mow away your stress with the soothing hum of a well-oiled engine. Fire up your mower and cut every blade of grass in sight. Build your own lawn care service and work on everything from exotic to ordinary lawns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and unwind in this satisfying lawn care simulator. Whether you\u2019re hedging for perfection or tackling wild overgrowth, no lawn is too daunting with your growing arsenal of mowers, trimmers, hedgers, leaf blowers and more. From backyard patches to sprawling estates, every job is a chance to leave your mark and keep the grass greener on <i>your</i> side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb the peaceful pace and rhythmic satisfaction of mowing. Craft satisfying but subtle stripes, shape elaborate patterns, or just clean up overgrown chaos. Your mowers are your brushes; the turf is your canvas. So sit back, relax, and let the clippings fly.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859750?t=1760385189","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859750?t=1760385189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859750/a689f2485e1571d786f2efdf44cc02c2be4528ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760385189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam